@2045[2]. It is self-love from which spring... all cruelties. @2327[end]. 29 10[2].

@2754. The modern Antediluvians... are cruel; they have cared only for themselves; and have accounted it nothing if the whole world were to perish for their sakes: there is a great number of such at this day... from Christendom: their Hell is the most grievous of all. @4327[end].

